### 1. Get Manager Dashboard Data
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/manager
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get All Departments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/departments
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Update Department Budget
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/departments/1/budget
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "budget": 7000.00
}

###

### 4. Get All Invoices
GET http://localhost:8080/api/invoices
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Create New Invoice
POST http://localhost:8080/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Software License",
  "amount": 450.00,
  "departmentId": 4
}